I heard that the Royal Shamans managed to close the portals that opened across the continent. But because of the Ancient Weapon's blast, space-time was badly damaged in this region, keeping this portal from closing.
With the information you gathered, the Royal Mages could begin an incursion into the Shadow Road to keep the monsters from coming back through the portal.
Help them stop these creatures. Your attack power will be lowered by 30% so you do not draw the monsters' attention.

[Challenge Objective]

Hunt 80 monsters on the Shadow Road, among them the Inferno, the Rusty Guardian or the Mysterious Shadow.
When you are done, talk to the Royal Mage on the Road to the Wind.
